      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَلَمَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A skinned sheep</i> or <i>goat</i> (S, K) <i>without
the intestines and without the legs,</i> (S,) [or] <i>when
the shanks and the redundant parts have gone.</i>
(K.) And the <i>whole flesh</i> of a slaughtered camel.
(S.) ― 
